🎮 WonderNest Game Design Document (GDD) 

Version: 0.1 (Concept Phase)

Vision 

WonderNest ek original multiplayer adventure game hai jiska main focus hai:

🤝 Friends ke saath maza 😂 Funny moments 👁️ Mystery 🥚 Secrets 🌍 Living World 🎬 Creativity 📖 Community Stories 

Ye game kisi ek genre me bandha hua nahi hai.

Isme adventure, comedy, mystery, exploration aur player creativity sab ek hi duniya me naturally exist karte hain.

Har login par player ko lage:

"Aaj WonderNest me kya naya milega?"

Main Concept 

WonderNest ek Living World Adventure Game hai.

Ye duniya kabhi completely reveal nahi hoti.

Har player:

Explore karta hai. Secrets discover karta hai. Hidden systems unlock karta hai. Duniya ko dheere-dheere samajhta hai. Apni stories create karta hai. 

Game ka objective sirf jeetna nahi hai.

Objective hai:

WonderNest ki duniya ko discover karna.

Core Philosophy 

WonderNest kisi mission list ka game nahi hai.

Ye curiosity ka game hai.

Player ko baar-baar ye feeling aani chahiye:

"Ye kya tha?" "Ye pehle nahi tha!" "Isko kaise unlock kiya?" "Friend ko bulao, usko bhi dikhana hai!" Main Gameplay Loop 

Explore

↓

Discover

↓

Unlock

↓

Experiment

↓

Create Memories

↓

Find New Secrets

↓

Repeat

Har update me naye secrets add kiye ja sakte hain.

Main Objective 

Player ka goal hai:

Duniya explore karna. Hidden fragments discover karna. Secret NPCs dhoondhna. Funny aur mysterious events experience karna. Friends ke saath adventures create karna. Community ke liye content banana. 

Game intentionally player ko har cheez directly explain nahi karega.

Discovery gameplay ka part hogi.

Identity 

WonderNest ki sabse badi pehchaan:

Every session should feel different.

Har server me kuchh alag ho sakta hai.

Har player ko alag experiences mil sakte hain.

WonderNest Name 

Wonder

Surprise

Curiosity

Adventure

Discovery

Nest

Ek jagah jahan alag-alag ideas, stories aur secrets ek saath rehte hain.

WonderNest ka meaning:

Ek aisi duniya jahan har kone me koi naya surprise chhupa ho.

Story Base 

Bahut purani baat hai.

Is duniya me ajeeb cheezein hamesha se exist karti thi.

Kuchh jagah funny thi.

Kuchh jagah mysterious.

Kuchh jagah bilkul normal dikhti thi.

Lekin...

Normal kabhi thi hi nahi.

Samay ke saath is duniya ke kai raaz kho gaye.

Kuchh log unhe dhoondhte rahe.

Kuchh log unpar yakeen hi nahi karte.

Ab...

Players WonderNest me aate hain.

Unka kaam sirf game khelna nahi.

Unka kaam hai:

Is duniya ko samajhna.

Uske raaz khojna.

Aur dheere-dheere WonderNest ki asli kahani ko reveal karna.

Ye kahani ek baar me nahi milegi.

Har secret.

Har hidden area.

Har NPC.

Har fragment.

Is kahani ka ek chhota hissa hoga.

World Design 

WonderNest ek open-world style Living World hai.

Ye duniya alag-alag zones me divided hogi.

Har zone ki apni personality hogi.

Koi zone funny hoga.

Koi mysterious.

Koi peaceful.

Koi bilkul normal dikhega.

Lekin har jagah kuchh na kuchh secret zaroor hoga.

Player kabhi bhi poori duniya ek saath samajh nahi paayega.

Har exploration me kuchh naya milna chahiye.

Living World Philosophy 

WonderNest ki duniya player ke aane ka wait nahi karti.

World hamesha zinda rahega.

NPC apna kaam karenge.

Animals apni life jeeyenge.

Weather change hoga.

Kuchh events randomly honge.

Kabhi funny.

Kabhi strange.

Kabhi mysterious.

Player sirf us duniya ka ek hissa hai.

Multiplayer Philosophy 

WonderNest solo bhi enjoy kiya ja sakta hai.

Lekin asli maza friends ke saath aata hai.

Players milkar:

Explore karenge. Secrets discover karenge. Hidden places dhoondhenge. Funny situations create karenge. Community memories banayenge. 

Game ka design teamwork encourage karega.

Lekin kisi player ko force nahi karega.

Player Progression 

WonderNest me progression sirf level se nahi hogi.

Progression ke multiple types honge.

Explorer Progress 

Kitni duniya discover ki.

Secret Progress 

Kitne hidden secrets mile.

Community Progress 

Kitne players ne tumhari creations dekhi.

Adventure Progress 

Kitni unique events experience ki.

Story Progress 

Kitne lore fragments unlock kiye.

Player ka progress uski journey batayega.

Sirf XP nahi.

Exploration Rules 

Har location me kuchh interesting hona chahiye.

Player ko kabhi aisa nahi lagna chahiye ki:

"Yahan aane ka koi reason hi nahi tha."

Har area me kam se kam ek:

Secret Funny Moment Hidden NPC Rare Event Lore Piece 

hona chahiye.

Hidden Fragments System 

WonderNest ki duniya chhote-chhote Hidden Fragments se bani hogi.

Ye game ka sabse important design pillars me se ek hai.

Har Fragment ek hidden experience hoga.

Examples:

Funny Fragment Horror Fragment Memory Fragment Time Fragment Movie Fragment Glitch Fragment Watcher Fragment 

Ye sab main gameplay ka compulsory part nahi honge.

Jo player explore karega.

Usko reward milega.

Secret Rooms 

Kai fragments secret rooms ke through unlock honge.

Ye rooms obvious nahi honge.

Player ko:

Observe karna padega.

Experiment karna padega.

Friends ke saath discuss karna padega.

Kabhi-kabhi community milkar hi solution discover karegi.

Discovery System 

WonderNest player ko sab kuchh directly nahi batayega.

Game intentionally kuchh cheezein chhupayega.

Players:

Khud experiment karenge.

Khud theories banayenge.

Khud discoveries share karenge.

Ye discovery system WonderNest ki identity ka important part hoga.

Player Memories 

Game ka goal sirf progress banana nahi hai.

Goal hai:

Players ko aise moments dena jo wo yaad rakhen.

Jaise:

"Yaad hai hum us secret room me galti se ghus gaye the?"

"Yaad hai woh funny NPC?"

"Yaad hai hume woh hidden fragment mila tha?"

WonderNest ki sabse badi achievement hogi:

Players apni stories khud banayenge.

Secret NPC System 

WonderNest me kuchh NPC sabko dikhai denge.

Lekin kuchh NPC sirf special conditions me hi milenge.

Inhe Secret NPCs kaha jayega.

Har Secret NPC ka apna behaviour, personality aur purpose hoga.

Kuchh friendly honge.

Kuchh funny.

Kuchh mysterious.

Kuchh player ko confuse karenge.

Har Secret NPC ko dhoondhna bhi ek achievement hoga.

Secret NPC Rules 

Secret NPC kabhi bhi map par marker ke saath appear nahi honge.

Player ko:

Explore karna padega. Experiment karna padega. Clues follow karne padenge. Kabhi-kabhi teamwork karna padega. 

Tab jaakar Secret NPC milenge.

Secret NPC Rewards 

Har Secret NPC kuchh unique de sakta hai.

Examples:

Rare dialogue Hidden information Secret Fragment Funny interaction Temporary special ability Hidden location ka clue 

Har NPC alag reward dega.

Easter Egg Philosophy 

WonderNest me Easter Eggs sirf references nahi honge.

Har Easter Egg ka koi purpose hoga.

Example:

Ek hidden room.

Ek hidden event.

Ek funny object.

Ek invisible character.

Ek impossible looking path.

Player ko lage:

"Ye developer ne seriously chhupaya tha!"

Hidden Fragments Expansion 

Har Hidden Fragment ek mini experience hoga.

Examples:

👁️ Watcher Fragment 

Mysterious observations.

Weird events.

Hidden lore.

😂 Funny Fragment 

Talking objects.

Strange NPC behaviour.

Unexpected jokes.

Living furniture.

🐞 Glitch Fragment 

Official hidden glitches.

Fake bugs.

Secret interactions.

Community discoveries.

🎬 Movie Fragment 

Movie Studio.

Actors.

Special camera tools.

Creative content.

🪞 Memory Fragment 

Old memories.

Past events.

Hidden history.

Replay moments.

⏳ Time Fragment 

Time-related Secret NPC.

Temporary gameplay changes.

Rare events.

Hidden Rooms 

WonderNest me kai hidden rooms honge.

Har room ka theme alag hoga.

Player ko kabhi directly nahi bataya jayega.

Room unlock karne ke tareeke:

Puzzle Hidden switch NPC clue Teamwork Secret interaction Random rare event Community Discoveries 

Developer har secret officially reveal nahi karega.

Community khud discover karegi.

Players:

Videos banayenge. Friends ko batayenge. Theories banayenge. Discussions karenge. 

Ye WonderNest ki community ko active rakhega.

Funny Moments 

Funny moments scripted bhi ho sakte hain.

Aur random bhi.

Examples:

Object player se baat kare. NPC ajeeb answer de. Koi event bilkul unexpected ho. 

Funny moments kabhi gameplay disturb nahi karenge.

Sirf experience improve karenge.

Hidden Dialogue 

Kuchh NPC har player se same baat nahi karenge.

Dialogue depend karega:

Progress Discoveries Time Secret unlocks Random chance 

Isse har player ka experience thoda alag hoga.

Exploration Reward 

WonderNest explore karna hamesha rewarding hona chahiye.

Player ko kabhi aisa nahi lagna chahiye:

"Main itni door aaya aur kuchh mila hi nahi."

Chahe bada reward na mile.

Lekin:

Funny dialogue Secret clue Hidden object Lore NPC interaction 

kuchh na kuchh zaroor milna chahiye.

WonderNest Rule 

Har secret discover karna compulsory nahi hai.

Lekin...

Jitna player explore karega.

Utni WonderNest ki asli duniya uske saamne khulti jayegi.

Isi wajah se har player ki journey alag hogi.

The Watcher System 

The Watcher WonderNest ka hidden mystery layer hai.

Ye main villain nahi hai.

Ye har player ke saamne nahi aata.

Kuchh players usko kabhi nahi dekhenge.

Kuchh players uske baare me sirf rumours sunenge.

Aur kuchh lucky (ya unlucky) players uske encounters experience karenge.

Is system ka purpose players ko daraana nahi.

Purpose hai:

Curiosity.

Mystery.

Discussion.

Community theories.

Watcher Rules 

Watcher player ko random attack nahi karega.

Wo observe karega.

Kabhi door khada dikhega.

Kabhi ek second ke liye.

Kabhi sirf reflection me.

Kabhi kisi object ke peeche.

Kabhi sirf ek shadow.

Player confirm hi nahi kar payega ki usne sach me dekha tha ya imagination thi.

Funny + Horror Balance 

WonderNest pure horror game nahi hai.

Pure comedy game bhi nahi hai.

Balance hamesha maintain rahega.

Example:

Player dara.

5 minute baad...

Ek talking chair bole:

"Bhai bhaagna band kar, thak jayega."

Is tarah tension toot jayegi.

Game continuously horror mode me nahi rahega.

Living Objects System 

WonderNest me kuchh hidden places par objects zinda honge.

Examples:

Chair

Table

Tree

Dustbin

Lamp

Painting

Mirror

Ye objects:

Baat kar sakte hain.

Joke maar sakte hain.

Player ko confuse kar sakte hain.

Clues de sakte hain.

Ya bilkul ignore kar sakte hain.

Har object ki apni personality hogi.

Hidden Glitch System 

WonderNest me kuchh glitches intentionally honge.

Ye bugs nahi.

Official hidden mechanics honge.

Example:

Wall ke andar secret passage.

Weird visual.

Object duplicate.

Invisible bridge.

Impossible jump.

Game kabhi officially nahi bolega:

"Ye secret hai."

Community khud discover karegi.

Rare Events 

Kabhi-kabhi duniya me rare events honge.

Ye schedule par nahi chalenge.

Ye random bhi ho sakte hain.

Conditions based bhi.

Rare events ka purpose:

Players ko baar-baar login karne ka reason dena.

World Reactions 

WonderNest ki duniya player ke actions ya discoveries par react kar sakti hai.

Example:

Ek hidden secret discover hua.

Kuchh NPC ka dialogue badal gaya.

Koi object naya behaviour dikhane laga.

Ek hidden room unlock ho gaya.

Ye reactions permanent bhi ho sakte hain.

Temporary bhi.

Mystery Philosophy 

Game har question ka answer nahi dega.

Kuchh cheezein intentionally unanswered rahengi.

Community khud theories banayegi.

Developer sab confirm nahi karega.

Isse WonderNest ki mystery zinda rahegi.

Fear Without Punishment 

Watcher ya mysterious events ka purpose player ko punish karna nahi hai.

Ye exploration ko interesting banana hai.

Player ko curiosity feel honi chahiye.

Na ki frustration.

Community Stories 

Developer ki story sirf aadhi hogi.

Baaki aadhi story community banayegi.

Players:

Screenshots share karenge.

Videos banayenge.

Theories discuss karenge.

Hidden discoveries compare karenge.

Isi wajah se WonderNest ki duniya har update ke baad aur badi feel hogi.

Design Rule 

Har mysterious event ke baad player ko do feelings milni chahiye:

"Ye kya tha?"

"Mujhe dobara dekhna hai."

Agar player sirf dar kar game band kar de...

To system fail maana jayega.

Agar player friend ko bula kar bole:

"Chal tujhe kuchh dikhata hoon."

To system successful maana jayega.

Movie Studio System 

Movie Studio WonderNest ka ek optional creative feature hai.

Ye main gameplay ka compulsory part nahi hai.

Jo players explore karenge aur unlock karenge, wahi is system ka use kar sakenge.

Movie Studio ka purpose hai:

Creativity Community Funny Moments Storytelling Movie Studio Unlock 

Movie Studio shuru se available nahi hoga.

Players ko:

Explore karna hoga. Hidden clues dhoondhne honge. Secret Fragment discover karna hoga. 

Tab jaakar Movie Studio unlock hoga.

Studio Philosophy 

Movie Studio ek normal video recorder nahi hai.

Ye WonderNest ke andar ek proper creative workshop hai.

Yahan players apni imagination se stories bana sakte hain.

Developer sirf tools dega.

Story players banayenge.

Actor System 

Movie banane ke liye actors chahiye.

Players ko actors dhoondhne padenge.

Har actor ki apni personality hogi.

Examples:

Villager Monkey King Guard Ghost Robot Rare Characters Secret Characters 

Har actor har movie me kaam karne ke liye ready nahi hoga.

Kuchh actors ko unlock karna padega.

Kuchh actors sirf special conditions me milenge.

Movie Creation 

Player movie banate waqt:

Actors choose karega. Camera set karega. Scene create karega. Environment choose karega. Dialogue add karega. Emotes aur animations use karega. 

Future updates me aur tools add kiye ja sakte hain.

Publish System 

Movie complete hone ke baad player usko publish kar sakta hai.

Published movies community dekh sakti hai.

Community Features 

Har published movie par:

❤️ Like

⭐ Favourite

💬 Comment

👥 Creator Follow

jaise features available honge.

Featured Movies 

Future me developer best movies ko choose kar sakta hai.

Unhe:

⭐ Featured

ya

🎬 WonderNest Originals

jaisa tag mil sakta hai.

Best Creator 

Movie creators ke liye alag recognition system ho sakta hai.

Examples:

Best Director Best Comedy Best Horror Best Adventure Best Story Best Trailer 

Ye titles gameplay advantage nahi denge.

Sirf achievement aur respect ke liye honge.

Collaboration 

Future updates me multiple players milkar ek movie bana sakte hain.

Roles:

Director Camera Actor Editor Voice Actor 

Ye optional feature hoga.

Movie Rewards 

Movie publish karne par player ko rewards mil sakte hain.

Rewards gameplay balance ko affect nahi karenge.

Possible rewards:

Cosmetic Items Titles Decorations Creator Badge Community Creativity 

Movie Studio ka main goal hai:

Players sirf game na khelen.

Players WonderNest ki duniya ka use karke apni kahaniyan bhi bana saken.

Har movie alag hogi.

Har creator ki style alag hogi.

Developer imagination ko limit nahi karega.

Design Rule 

Movie Studio kabhi bhi main gameplay ko replace nahi karega.

Ye WonderNest ka creative extension hai.

Jo player sirf adventure enjoy karna chahe...

Wo bina Movie Studio ke bhi complete experience le sake.

Jo player creator banna chahe...

Uske liye Movie Studio ek nayi journey shuru karega.

Future Expansion Philosophy 

WonderNest ek aisa game design kiya jayega jise saalon tak expand kiya ja sake.

Har update sirf naye items add nahi karega.

Har update duniya ko aur zinda banayega.

Players ko hamesha lage:

"Is update me developer ne kya chhupa rakha hai?"

Update Philosophy 

Har update me kam se kam ek naya hidden experience hona chahiye.

Examples:

Hidden NPC Secret Room Hidden Fragment Funny Event Rare Interaction New Lore Piece Mystery 

Players ko update ke baad explore karne ka reason milna chahiye.

Community First 

WonderNest ki sabse badi taakat uski community hogi.

Players:

Theories banayenge. Guides likhenge. Friends ko secrets dikhayenge. Movies banayenge. Funny moments share karenge. Hidden discoveries compare karenge. 

Developer community ki creativity ko support karega.

No Pay-to-Win 

WonderNest me gameplay advantage paise se nahi milega.

Premium ya future paid content sirf:

Cosmetics Decorations Creator Tools Visual Items Optional Extras 

tak limited rahega.

Core gameplay sabke liye fair rahega.

Developer Philosophy 

Developer har secret reveal nahi karega.

Kuchh cheezein intentionally hidden rahengi.

Community ko khud discover karne diya jayega.

Kabhi-kabhi developer sirf hints dega.

Seedha answer nahi.

Mix Vault 

Development ke dauran bahut saare ideas discuss hue.

Inme se kuchh main features bane.

Kuchh future updates ke liye save kiye gaye.

Kuchh Easter Eggs me convert kiye gaye.

Mix Vault ka purpose hai:

Koi bhi achha idea kabhi waste na ho.

Future me zarurat padne par use improve karke add kiya ja sake.

Core Design Pillars 

WonderNest hamesha in principles ko follow karega:

🤝 Friends First 

Friends ke saath maza solo gameplay se bhi important hai.

🌍 Living World 

World player ke bina bhi zinda feel hona chahiye.

🥚 Discovery 

Secrets hamesha exploration reward hone chahiye.

😂 Fun 

Funny moments naturally gameplay ka hissa hone chahiye.

👁️ Mystery 

Har cheez ka answer turant nahi milna chahiye.

🎬 Creativity 

Players ko create karne ki freedom milni chahiye.

❤️ Community 

Community WonderNest ki growth ka important part hogi.

Golden Rules 

Kisi bhi existing game ki direct copy nahi karni.

Inspiration li ja sakti hai.

Har feature ko WonderNest ki identity ke hisaab se redesign kiya jayega.

Funny aur mystery ka balance maintain rahega.

Har update me kuchh discover karne layak hona chahiye.

Har hidden system ka koi purpose hona chahiye.

Players ko experiment karne ka reward milna chahiye.

Community discussion ko encourage kiya jayega.

Gameplay hamesha smooth aur accessible hona chahiye.

WonderNest ka ultimate goal sirf game banana nahi...

WonderNest ka goal hai:

Players ko aise moments dena jo wo apne friends ko excitement ke saath sunaayen.

