WonderNest Expansion Notes (Version 0.2) Developer Mindset 

WonderNest ko kabhi bhi "feature collection" nahi banana.

Har naya feature ek reason ke saath add hoga.

Question hamesha ye hoga:

"Ye feature player ke experience ko better bana raha hai ya sirf list lambi kar raha hai?"

Agar answer "No" hua...

Feature reject kar diya jayega.

Feature Priority 

Development order:

Core Gameplay Multiplayer Experience Living World Hidden Fragments Secret NPCs Funny Systems Mystery Systems Community Features Movie Studio Future Expansions Hidden Fragments Philosophy 

Har Hidden Fragment optional hoga.

Player bina uske bhi game enjoy kar sakega.

Lekin jo player explore karega...

Usko WonderNest ki asli depth samajh aayegi.

Community Discovery Rule 

Developer kabhi officially nahi bolega:

"Congratulations! Tumne sab secrets discover kar liye."

WonderNest me hamesha kuchh unknown rehna chahiye.

Har update ke baad players fir se theories banana shuru kar dein.

Replay Value 

WonderNest ka replay value sirf missions se nahi aayega.

Replay value aayega:

Different players Different discoveries Different funny events Different community stories Different hidden interactions 

Har baar kuchh alag feel hona chahiye.

Player Freedom 

Game player ko force nahi karega.

Player choose karega:

Explore karna hai. Friends ke saath masti karni hai. Secrets dhoondhne hain. Movie banani hai. Sirf time pass karna hai. 

Har playstyle valid hogi.

Long-Term Goal 

WonderNest ka dream hai:

Ek aisi duniya banana...

Jahan players sirf game complete karne ke liye na aayein.

Wo isliye laut kar aayein kyunki:

"Yaar... WonderNest me ghoomte hain."

Ye feeling hi WonderNest ki sabse badi success hogi.

Development Motto 

"Create memories, not just missions."

Ye line WonderNest ke development ka permanent motto rahegi.

